WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.260 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 18]

01:39.560 --> 01:41.100
So, what's your goal

01:42.870 --> 01:43.660
for coming here?

01:44.820 --> 01:49.100
[Blood River members involved in the Wushuang City attack: Su Xiemo]

01:53.120 --> 01:53.770
Don't worry.

01:54.840 --> 01:55.490
We came here

01:55.510 --> 01:56.490
with no goals in mind.

01:57.280 --> 01:58.380
Xiao Zhaoyan is my younger sister.

01:59.000 --> 01:59.690
She's here

02:01.000 --> 02:01.850
because I requested the Patriarch

02:01.870 --> 02:03.380
to send her here back then.

02:05.150 --> 02:06.180
I see.

02:21.030 --> 02:22.500
If so, I shall not bother you all.

02:22.910 --> 02:23.540
Farewell.

02:35.870 --> 02:37.100
That guy is kind of interesting.

02:38.400 --> 02:39.980
He was a little surprised

02:40.240 --> 02:41.500
when he found out about our identities.

02:42.120 --> 02:42.820
However,

02:43.120 --> 02:43.850
he wants to

02:43.870 --> 02:45.060
keep a distance from us after that.

02:47.080 --> 02:47.820
The people here

02:48.030 --> 02:48.690
are most terrified of

02:48.710 --> 02:50.060
getting involved with Blood River.

02:51.080 --> 02:52.010
There are plenty of retired members

02:52.030 --> 02:52.820
like

02:52.960 --> 02:53.660
Mr. Xiemo.

02:55.680 --> 02:56.660
If we can

02:56.870 --> 02:58.410
recruit them into Blood River again,

02:59.280 --> 03:00.570
they'll form an unstoppable force.

03:01.630 --> 03:03.340
Therefore, after he found out about your identities,

03:03.910 --> 03:05.340
he left immediately upon knowing that you didn't come here

03:05.520 --> 03:06.260
for him.

03:07.080 --> 03:08.260
If he found out that you guys came to find them,

03:09.310 --> 03:10.380
we would've been in some trouble.

03:15.630 --> 03:16.100
Let's drop the topic.

03:17.190 --> 03:18.610
Didn't you say that we would enjoy meat and liquor

03:18.630 --> 03:19.680
every meal?

03:20.190 --> 03:20.690
Where's the meat?

03:21.030 --> 03:21.660
Where's the liquor?

03:23.120 --> 03:24.170
This is our homemade rice wine.

03:24.400 --> 03:24.980
It's very strong.

03:25.120 --> 03:25.690
Do you dare to drink it?

03:27.960 --> 03:28.820
I've never gotten drunk, you know?

03:34.380 --> 03:38.700
[Flying Tiger General's Residence]

03:42.150 --> 03:43.290
Since you dare to seek an audience with me

03:43.310 --> 03:45.170
at Uncle's residence in the middle of the day,

03:46.240 --> 03:47.340
does that mean

03:47.630 --> 03:48.940
you've persuaded the Three Families successfully?

03:50.190 --> 03:50.570
Indeed.

03:51.870 --> 03:52.690
Your Highness,

03:52.910 --> 03:54.450
Grandfather and the rest have agreed to join hands with you.

03:57.120 --> 03:57.780
Excellent.

03:58.750 --> 03:59.850
A wise man adapts himself

04:00.310 --> 04:01.340
to the changing times.

04:01.910 --> 04:03.450
Yi Bu wouldn't have ended up like this

04:04.000 --> 04:05.940
had he understood the meaning of that line.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.340
As for you,

04:09.360 --> 04:10.730
you made the right decision.

04:11.630 --> 04:12.690
Since young,

04:13.560 --> 04:14.450
it felt strange to me

04:15.280 --> 04:16.050
that the Shadow Guards

04:16.070 --> 04:17.100
could come and go at will

04:18.040 --> 04:19.050
while the Three Families

04:19.600 --> 04:21.660
could only keep watch over Wanjuan Tower,

04:22.390 --> 04:23.100
and become the bodyguards

04:23.870 --> 04:25.660
of Yi Bu's Shadow Sect.

04:29.190 --> 04:30.900
Until the day I saw Su Muyu.

04:31.800 --> 04:32.460
That's when I understood

04:32.480 --> 04:34.170
why I had to endure defiance and unwillingness

04:34.830 --> 04:36.050
all these years

04:39.160 --> 04:40.490
Su Muyu was unhappy about

04:40.510 --> 04:41.730
being the shadow of the Shadow Sect.

04:42.560 --> 04:43.730
Does he think that I'm happy about that?

04:44.630 --> 04:45.780
Grandfather and the rest may have been old,

04:46.160 --> 04:47.340
but I'm still young.

04:48.040 --> 04:48.850
The younger generations

04:48.870 --> 04:50.610
are brave enough to carve a new world out of the old.

04:51.190 --> 04:52.170
Your Highness,

04:52.870 --> 04:54.140
I'm willing to be your arrow.

04:54.600 --> 04:56.340
On the day you release it,

04:56.830 --> 04:58.700
once you help me make a name for myself,

04:59.510 --> 05:01.410
by then, we can see

05:01.830 --> 05:03.980
whether or not Su Muyu of the martial world is stronger

05:04.630 --> 05:06.290
than our forces

05:07.000 --> 05:07.660
in the imperial palace.

05:10.000 --> 05:10.700
Excellent.

05:12.270 --> 05:12.900
Very good.

05:14.310 --> 05:14.780
By the way,

05:16.120 --> 05:16.700
on that night,

05:17.120 --> 05:18.490
I assume they've retrieved the letter

05:19.070 --> 05:20.410
that belonged

05:21.310 --> 05:22.460
to their own compartments, right?

05:23.630 --> 05:24.250
They have.

05:26.040 --> 05:26.700
Excellent.

05:27.310 --> 05:28.410
After Blood River selected a new leader,

05:29.040 --> 05:29.810
Yi Bu ordered his men

05:29.830 --> 05:31.410
to retrieve everything in the compartment.

05:32.390 --> 05:33.490
Your Highness, did you feed them

05:33.510 --> 05:34.410
with false information?

05:35.240 --> 05:35.660
No.

05:36.480 --> 05:37.490
Of course they're true.

05:38.390 --> 05:39.140
It might even be

05:40.000 --> 05:41.540
more detailed

05:42.070 --> 05:43.460
than the original document.

05:44.480 --> 05:46.810
It's because I bought the information

05:46.830 --> 05:48.540
from Baixiao Hall many years ago.

05:49.830 --> 05:51.220
Back then, Baixiao Hall

05:52.190 --> 05:53.050
was still untainted

05:53.070 --> 05:54.780
by the forces of Prince of Langya.

05:56.190 --> 05:57.580
Your Highness, why are you helping them out?

05:59.830 --> 06:01.140
It's because it'll be their turn

06:02.870 --> 06:04.580
to help me out soon.

06:08.000 --> 06:08.540
Ms. Yumo.

06:10.040 --> 06:11.020
Please help me keep an eye on

06:11.190 --> 06:12.220
the movements of Tianqi's Xuanwu Guardian.

06:13.720 --> 06:14.730
We had a promise.

06:15.270 --> 06:16.610
But when I visited the Inner Security Division yesterday,

06:16.950 --> 06:17.810
their men said

06:18.190 --> 06:19.370
that they hadn't seen him around for a long time.

06:20.480 --> 06:21.410
If you receive any news of him

06:22.070 --> 06:22.780
returning to Tianqi,

06:23.190 --> 06:24.100
please notify me immediately.

06:27.920 --> 06:28.250
Yes, ma'am.

06:38.750 --> 06:40.250
He has never gotten drunk?

06:40.480 --> 06:42.100
He fell unconscious just after one bowl.

06:44.830 --> 06:46.340
Changhe has a mystical ability.

06:46.870 --> 06:48.490
When he wants to get drunk, one cup is enough.

06:48.720 --> 06:49.700
But when he wants to stay sober,

06:50.070 --> 06:51.490
he won't get drunk

06:51.510 --> 06:52.100
no matter

06:52.720 --> 06:53.980
how much liquor he drinks.

06:54.480 --> 06:55.520
If so, why did he choose

06:55.600 --> 06:56.980
to get drunk so early tonight?

06:58.120 --> 06:58.850
It's because he knows

07:00.070 --> 07:00.700
that I have some private matters

07:01.720 --> 07:02.700
to tell you.

07:03.070 --> 07:03.660
What is it?

07:21.920 --> 07:23.490
I found some past secrets

07:25.390 --> 07:26.810
in Tianqi City's Wanjuan Tower.

07:28.720 --> 07:29.660
I also found out

07:29.680 --> 07:30.540
about the identity of the culprit

07:32.480 --> 07:34.100
who wiped out No-Sword City back then.

07:35.190 --> 07:35.930
Who was it?

07:37.680 --> 07:38.340
It was Blood River.

07:40.750 --> 07:41.850
Is that true?

07:45.390 --> 07:46.050
Back then,

07:47.510 --> 07:49.050
Blood River sent out 93 of their members

07:49.070 --> 07:49.900
as per the order.

07:51.310 --> 07:52.410
Together with

07:52.430 --> 07:53.730
several of Zhou Yuluo's personal disciples,

07:54.950 --> 07:56.540
they caused The Uprising of No-Sword City.

08:01.360 --> 08:02.490
Zhou Yuluo's family

08:02.510 --> 08:03.340
had a total of 67 members.

08:06.870 --> 08:08.580
Only their young lord, who was still a child, survived.

08:11.390 --> 08:12.460
He escaped along the river.

08:13.920 --> 08:14.900
He was captured by Blood River.

08:18.680 --> 08:20.660
The young lord of No-Sword City was born with an affinity for swords.

08:22.360 --> 08:24.220
The head of the Su family coveted his talent.

08:24.750 --> 08:26.290
Thus, he arranged for him to enter the Furnace.

08:27.310 --> 08:28.660
He nurtured him as a Nameless

08:30.480 --> 08:32.340
so that he could serve the Su family in the future.

08:36.150 --> 08:37.340
Blood River?

08:41.150 --> 08:41.650
Indeed.

08:45.270 --> 08:47.100
The culprit that I've been searching for,

08:51.000 --> 08:51.610
it's actually the place

08:51.630 --> 08:52.820
I grew up in.

08:58.790 --> 08:59.820
There were 93 assassins

09:00.750 --> 09:01.580
dispatched for duty.

09:02.320 --> 09:03.580
18 of them survived.

09:06.390 --> 09:07.650
I reviewed the name list.

09:09.150 --> 09:10.340
I know none of them.

09:11.510 --> 09:12.580
It's because they were murdered

09:12.600 --> 09:13.700
in the middle of their missions

09:13.720 --> 09:14.460
after the incident.

09:16.000 --> 09:16.700
You can take a look.

09:30.780 --> 09:33.980
[Blood River members involved in the Wushuang City attack: Su Xiemo]

09:34.320 --> 09:34.940
Su...

09:37.360 --> 09:38.420
Su Xiemo?

09:39.390 --> 09:40.060
Continue reading.

09:44.670 --> 09:45.770
Su Xiaoyan.

09:47.150 --> 09:48.220
Xie Shuitao.

09:49.270 --> 09:50.180
Mu Tianze.

09:52.150 --> 09:52.980
These names...

09:53.510 --> 09:54.820
Do you know them?

09:57.000 --> 09:57.850
All these people,

10:01.720 --> 10:02.700
they're

10:04.390 --> 10:05.460
in the Homeland.

10:06.790 --> 10:07.300
Understood.

10:09.870 --> 10:11.180
Yu, what are you up to?

10:12.120 --> 10:13.300
I'm just going to ask them some questions.

10:14.480 --> 10:15.340
Wait here for me.

10:17.600 --> 10:18.770
If the guy inside is awake,

10:20.240 --> 10:21.530
tell him to stay put.

10:23.320 --> 10:23.770
Yu!

10:26.440 --> 10:26.890
Don't worry.

10:27.790 --> 10:28.650
I can't just slaughter

10:28.670 --> 10:29.490
the entire village

10:30.790 --> 10:31.770
just after I said that

10:31.790 --> 10:32.370
this was my home yesterday.

10:34.360 --> 10:35.220
Where does Su Xiemo live?

10:36.360 --> 10:37.010
The third house

10:37.360 --> 10:37.940
from the village entrance.

10:39.030 --> 10:39.530
All right.

10:42.440 --> 10:42.980
Please be careful.

11:14.440 --> 11:15.370
Senior, you're in a great mood, huh?

11:16.750 --> 11:17.890
It's been a habit of mine for many years.

11:19.120 --> 11:20.130
Enjoying a vat of wine

11:21.440 --> 11:22.770
and a plate of peanuts

11:24.630 --> 11:25.650
is the only

11:26.440 --> 11:27.370
enjoyable moment

11:27.870 --> 11:28.890
of my day.

11:31.600 --> 11:32.220
I understand.

11:34.720 --> 11:36.250
I figured out who you were

11:38.150 --> 11:39.580
after our first encounter.

11:40.720 --> 11:41.770
You resemble

11:42.480 --> 11:43.420
the younger version of your father

11:44.910 --> 11:46.060
a lot.

11:47.630 --> 11:49.220
My swordsmanship

11:49.240 --> 11:49.940
is also

11:51.720 --> 11:52.890
on par with his.

11:56.360 --> 11:57.130
Is your umbrella

11:58.390 --> 11:59.250
your sword?

12:18.390 --> 12:20.130
I keep 18 swords in my umbrella.

12:22.120 --> 12:23.130
And, there are a total of

12:23.150 --> 12:24.060
18 people here.

12:25.080 --> 12:26.130
Just nice. One sword

12:27.440 --> 12:29.010
for each of you.

12:37.080 --> 12:38.490
I can tell why the head of the Su family

12:39.440 --> 12:41.010
took a liking to you immediately.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.730
I can't believe that someone picked up the Eighteen-Sword Array.

12:46.960 --> 12:47.610
All of you

12:47.630 --> 12:48.610
were supposed to be dead.

12:49.790 --> 12:51.650
Why are all of you in the Homeland?

12:53.190 --> 12:54.220
Back then, Soul Reapers' Hall

12:54.240 --> 12:55.170
gave us this mission.

12:56.630 --> 12:58.400
At first, the Patriarch refused to accept it.

13:00.160 --> 13:01.690
The eradication of No-Sword City

13:01.720 --> 13:03.330
would bring a huge impact.

13:05.630 --> 13:07.100
It would shake the foundation of Blood River.

13:09.200 --> 13:11.100
However, the Soul Reapers' Hall was very adamant about it.

13:12.790 --> 13:14.730
Due to that, Blood River suffered heavy casualties.

13:16.240 --> 13:18.430
Out of 93 expert assassins who were dispatched,

13:19.270 --> 13:21.220
only 18 of them survived.

13:24.200 --> 13:25.220
And, these 18 survivors

13:25.630 --> 13:27.580
were hunted and pursued

13:30.030 --> 13:31.060
during

13:31.960 --> 13:32.650
their missions.

13:35.720 --> 13:37.010
No one could find out about the mission

13:37.030 --> 13:38.700
Blood River would accept in advance.

13:40.390 --> 13:41.060
Except for

13:44.080 --> 13:45.010
the Soul Reapers' Hall.

13:45.910 --> 13:46.420
Indeed.

13:48.030 --> 13:49.250
The Patriarch also suspected

13:50.270 --> 13:53.220
that Soul Reapers' Hall and the one who placed the order

13:54.630 --> 13:55.730
wanted to silence us.

13:59.790 --> 14:01.460
The art of silencing people

14:01.670 --> 14:03.490
never existed in Blood River.

14:04.120 --> 14:05.250
It's because you guys have no information

14:05.270 --> 14:06.300
about your employers.

14:07.550 --> 14:08.940
There's no need to silence them.

14:09.840 --> 14:10.580
But that time

14:11.600 --> 14:12.180
was different.

14:14.030 --> 14:15.130
The employer desired

14:16.120 --> 14:17.580
the precious sword manuals

14:17.600 --> 14:18.700
of No-Sword City.

14:20.000 --> 14:21.100
On the night our men

14:21.120 --> 14:22.370
charged into the city,

14:22.870 --> 14:24.700
some of their men who had infiltrated the city

14:24.910 --> 14:25.980
were fighting for

14:26.440 --> 14:27.890
the sword manuals.

14:29.120 --> 14:30.570
And for a brief moment,

14:31.080 --> 14:32.460
our two forces

14:33.240 --> 14:34.700
clashed by mistake.

14:35.840 --> 14:37.850
It was during the clash

14:38.550 --> 14:39.580
that I figured out

14:40.480 --> 14:41.850
the sword techniques they were using.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.700
Riding the sword to the Ninth Heaven...

14:51.750 --> 14:53.300
As the dragon falls into the Yellow Springs.

14:53.720 --> 14:54.180
That's right.

14:55.670 --> 14:56.770
It was the Ninth Heaven Sword Technique.

14:58.510 --> 14:59.300
Wushuang City?

15:04.910 --> 15:05.580
Calm down.

15:09.750 --> 15:10.730
Once this technique is used,

15:12.630 --> 15:13.700
every other sword technique will pale in comparison.

15:16.240 --> 15:17.980
However, the strongest city in the world

15:18.000 --> 15:18.700
with an unparalleled reputation,

15:20.480 --> 15:22.370
also made a name for itself due to its sword techniques.

15:26.480 --> 15:27.250
Wushuang City, huh?

15:30.120 --> 15:32.100
That answer chills my heart.

15:34.960 --> 15:35.820
Why do you say so?

15:38.550 --> 15:39.580
It's because my father

15:39.960 --> 15:41.580
once complimented the swordsmanship

15:41.600 --> 15:43.130
of Liu Yunqi, the former lord of Wushuang City.

15:45.390 --> 15:47.060
He felt a faint sense of kinship toward him.

15:49.270 --> 15:50.060
What a shame.

15:52.000 --> 15:52.650
Mr. Su,

15:54.480 --> 15:55.340
I've already told you

15:56.270 --> 15:57.420
everything I know.

15:58.910 --> 16:00.060
But there are certain things

16:00.960 --> 16:01.820
I wish to tell you.

16:02.670 --> 16:03.650
There's no emotional bond

16:04.270 --> 16:05.770
between you and us.

16:06.960 --> 16:09.060
We don't feel any guilt at all.

16:10.510 --> 16:11.850
Blood River was just following orders.

16:12.840 --> 16:13.650
It's the same for you.

16:17.510 --> 16:18.250
Therefore,

16:19.550 --> 16:21.250
if you wish to seek revenge,

16:24.390 --> 16:25.770
we'll surely kill you.

16:31.670 --> 16:32.610
Even if I wish to seek revenge,

16:34.030 --> 16:35.610
I should seek the culprit behind everything.

16:36.750 --> 16:37.650
I understand that.

16:38.960 --> 16:39.730
Moreover,

16:41.670 --> 16:42.530
after joining the Homeland,

16:45.150 --> 16:47.370
all of your honors and sins will be washed away.

16:48.670 --> 16:50.370
That will never change.

17:00.200 --> 17:00.820
Master Su.

17:03.000 --> 17:03.530
Thank you.

17:06.880 --> 17:07.900
It's been many years

17:08.590 --> 17:09.490
since

17:09.510 --> 17:10.660
we wielded a sword.

17:11.790 --> 17:13.050
Now, we're better at using hoes

17:14.070 --> 17:14.900
compared to

17:15.480 --> 17:16.380
swords.

17:19.480 --> 17:19.940
Farewell.

17:27.310 --> 17:27.700
Sir.

17:28.440 --> 17:29.050
Why are you scared of him?

17:29.830 --> 17:30.530
We have plenty of people here.

17:30.790 --> 17:31.860
I'm sure we can kill a brat like him.

17:33.400 --> 17:34.810
I'm afraid we can't.

17:36.070 --> 17:37.250
The Eighteen-Sword Array

17:37.960 --> 17:39.220
is no joke, you know?

17:41.960 --> 17:42.860
Moreover...

17:50.030 --> 17:50.460
Sir.

17:51.440 --> 17:52.380
Since when was he here?

17:52.830 --> 17:53.770
He's been here for a long time.

17:54.790 --> 17:56.010
Just now, when we showed up,

17:56.790 --> 17:57.380
that guy outside

17:57.400 --> 17:58.290
has already released his killing intent.

17:59.350 --> 18:00.290
If we attack him,

18:01.550 --> 18:02.620
he would surely rush into the room.

18:03.270 --> 18:05.630
He's the current Patriarch of Blood River,

18:06.550 --> 18:07.490
Su Changhe.

18:08.030 --> 18:08.810
Su Changhe, huh?

18:10.480 --> 18:11.250
Interesting.

18:12.510 --> 18:13.900
So, what's the aura surrounding him?

18:14.640 --> 18:15.810
He cultivated Hell Palm.

18:16.510 --> 18:17.860
- Hell Palm? - Hell Palm?

18:19.830 --> 18:20.660
I heard

18:21.200 --> 18:22.620
that it was a cursed art.

18:23.350 --> 18:25.250
Patriarchs who cultivated the art

18:25.960 --> 18:26.770
would have a tragic end.

18:27.510 --> 18:28.980
I don't believe in that type of saying.

18:30.200 --> 18:31.410
It's because most people like us

18:31.910 --> 18:33.300
have a tragic end.

18:33.990 --> 18:35.060
That's why it's making it

18:36.040 --> 18:36.850
as if

18:36.870 --> 18:38.490
every Patriarch who cultivated the art

18:39.480 --> 18:40.410
would have a tragic end.

18:42.640 --> 18:43.380
What are you doing here?

18:43.920 --> 18:44.940
Didn't I tell you not to come?

18:45.590 --> 18:46.570
I was drunk.

18:47.440 --> 18:47.940
I didn't hear what you said.

18:50.030 --> 18:51.570
Didn't I tell Zhaoyan to relay the message to you?

18:52.830 --> 18:54.570
Why should I listen to a lass like her?

18:56.070 --> 18:57.620
But since you don't intend to kill them,

18:58.070 --> 18:59.250
let's head to Nan'an tomorrow.

19:00.960 --> 19:01.810
What's with the sudden trip

19:02.240 --> 19:02.900
to Nan'an?

19:03.480 --> 19:04.660
I just received some news.

19:05.000 --> 19:06.380
Your beloved told us to go there and have some fun.

19:10.400 --> 19:11.180
Tell me the original message.

19:14.700 --> 19:15.700
[To Su Muyu]

19:19.030 --> 19:19.620
Su,

19:19.880 --> 19:20.570
may this letter find you well.

19:21.240 --> 19:22.570
I've returned to Nan'an City recently,

19:22.590 --> 19:23.780
and I wish to reopen my apothecary.

19:23.880 --> 19:26.220
Now, we have enough physicians.

19:26.400 --> 19:28.460
But we lack an apprentice to grind the herbs or tend to our guests.

19:29.070 --> 19:30.900
Muyu, I wonder if you're in the mood

19:30.920 --> 19:32.010
to work for us temporarily.

19:33.270 --> 19:35.200
It's fine even if you're busy.

19:35.480 --> 19:36.330
But remember this.

19:37.400 --> 19:39.420
Do not bring Changhe with you?

19:41.590 --> 19:42.660
I'm the only one he invited.

19:43.200 --> 19:43.900
Who said it was us?

19:44.830 --> 19:45.220
You!

19:46.830 --> 19:47.420
Just tell me.

19:48.070 --> 19:48.810
Will you head there or not?

19:51.160 --> 19:51.660
I guess.

19:52.510 --> 19:53.250
As for you,

19:54.510 --> 19:55.180
you should join me too.

19:57.160 --> 19:58.180
Could it be that you haven't received

19:58.400 --> 19:59.050
any useful news from them

19:59.070 --> 20:00.090
as of yet?

20:01.590 --> 20:02.460
What do you think?

20:08.260 --> 20:11.060
[Heyu Apothecary]

20:16.590 --> 20:17.940
A life like this

20:18.510 --> 20:19.900
is wonderful indeed.

20:23.750 --> 20:25.330
The incident with Blood River has been resolved.

20:25.750 --> 20:27.940
Don't you think you should think about

20:27.960 --> 20:29.140
your marriage now?

20:29.960 --> 20:30.700
Fadog!

20:30.960 --> 20:32.140
You're starting to spout nonsense again.

20:39.310 --> 20:40.460
I think Su Muyu

20:40.790 --> 20:41.900
is a great candidate.

20:44.310 --> 20:45.420
Among the people of Blood River,

20:45.750 --> 20:46.770
I like him the most.

20:49.640 --> 20:50.290
But you see,

20:50.440 --> 20:51.770
I don't like his type.

20:52.720 --> 20:53.940
He's too cold.

20:54.510 --> 20:55.220
He feels

20:55.510 --> 20:56.660
boring.

20:59.400 --> 21:01.420
Perhaps most of the women out there

21:01.790 --> 21:02.770
would like a guy like him.

21:03.270 --> 21:04.570
He has a gentle personality.

21:05.030 --> 21:05.490
And,

21:05.920 --> 21:07.380
he's good-looking.

21:09.110 --> 21:10.570
But...

21:11.200 --> 21:11.900
But what?

21:12.590 --> 21:13.730
But I prefer

21:13.750 --> 21:14.490
people who are interesting.

21:15.350 --> 21:16.290
For example,

21:17.240 --> 21:18.530
a person like Su Changhe.

21:22.270 --> 21:23.980
He's the Patriarch of Blood River.

21:24.550 --> 21:25.780
He's as strong as you can get.

21:25.780 --> 21:27.090
He has all the power he wants.

21:27.830 --> 21:28.570
And,

21:29.160 --> 21:29.660
he is

21:30.110 --> 21:30.980
very interesting.

21:31.440 --> 21:32.290
His manner of speech

21:32.550 --> 21:34.010
is very unique.

21:34.680 --> 21:37.010
He's a special man.

21:39.480 --> 21:40.730
That brat...

21:41.310 --> 21:42.220
You brat...

21:47.310 --> 21:47.810
Fadog.

21:48.720 --> 21:50.380
Where are you going?

21:51.400 --> 21:52.220
I cannot kill you.

21:52.510 --> 21:53.380
You're my daughter.

21:54.720 --> 21:55.700
However, I can choose to kill

21:55.720 --> 21:56.460
that brat, Su Changhe.

21:56.680 --> 21:57.380
Wait here.

21:57.480 --> 21:58.050
I'll return soon.

21:59.200 --> 22:00.810
He's the Patriarch of Blood River, you know?

22:01.310 --> 22:02.140
Su Muyu

22:02.310 --> 22:04.420
is just the head of the Su family.

22:04.830 --> 22:05.770
Fadog,

22:06.000 --> 22:07.180
why do you like Su Muyu that much?

22:07.720 --> 22:10.620
And, why do you hate Su Changhe that much?

22:11.830 --> 22:13.180
I know Su Changhe

22:13.400 --> 22:14.180
is powerful.

22:14.440 --> 22:15.700
But he's full of sinister thoughts.

22:16.440 --> 22:17.290
If you do marry him,

22:17.510 --> 22:18.770
it's fine if he bullies you.

22:19.000 --> 22:20.420
But I don't want you to be a widow.

22:21.550 --> 22:22.290
You see, heroes

22:22.440 --> 22:23.490
are often misunderstood

22:23.510 --> 22:25.700
by commoners like you.

22:27.240 --> 22:29.490
You see,

22:29.680 --> 22:31.010
Changhe is...

22:31.240 --> 22:32.140
Miss Bai,

22:32.270 --> 22:32.810
I never expected you

22:32.830 --> 22:33.980
to like me that much.

22:34.350 --> 22:35.810
You must be kidding me.

22:43.480 --> 22:45.050
Miss Bai, I fancy you as well.

22:47.400 --> 22:48.530
Why are you here instead?

22:49.000 --> 22:50.250
Who is it you wish to see, then?

23:00.920 --> 23:02.330
Who is this?

23:03.920 --> 23:04.940
She's the woman

23:04.960 --> 23:06.380
Su Muyu cares for the most.

23:06.750 --> 23:07.660
She's Su Muyu's

23:07.680 --> 23:09.330
childhood sweetheart.

23:09.680 --> 23:10.620
She's Xiao Zhaoyan.

23:10.770 --> 23:12.050
She comes from Blood River's Homeland.

23:15.830 --> 23:16.380
We're heading to Nan'an.

23:17.400 --> 23:18.220
There's a miracle physician there.

23:18.920 --> 23:20.570
And, she lacks an apprentice to grind her medicine for her.

23:22.310 --> 23:23.050
So,

23:23.240 --> 23:25.380
the person Su Muyu misses often,

23:25.550 --> 23:26.730
the member from the Homeland,

23:27.200 --> 23:28.330
it's you, Ms. Xiao.

23:29.440 --> 23:31.380
Greetings, Miss Bai. I'm Younger Sister Xiao.

23:31.830 --> 23:32.770
Younger sister?

23:33.750 --> 23:34.900
Does that mean

23:35.240 --> 23:37.180
she's younger than me?

23:37.790 --> 23:38.570
Someone's feeling a little sensitive.

23:39.960 --> 23:41.530
Someone's feeling a little sensitive, huh?

23:42.440 --> 23:44.730
Lass, you're not eloquent at all.

23:45.310 --> 23:46.900
Miss Bai is merely 30 years old.

23:47.200 --> 23:48.530
How could you address her as such?

23:49.680 --> 23:50.650
You should address her as...

23:50.680 --> 23:51.180
Fadog!

23:51.680 --> 23:52.050
Yes, my girl.

23:52.440 --> 23:53.220
Kill him!

23:54.200 --> 23:54.620
Roger that!

23:56.160 --> 23:56.660
No escape for you!

23:58.070 --> 23:58.570
Uncle Zhe!

23:59.160 --> 23:59.660
Calm down!

24:00.000 --> 24:00.490
You can't hit me!

24:01.480 --> 24:02.380
Ms. Xiao,

24:03.000 --> 24:03.940
since you're here,

24:04.590 --> 24:05.570
where's Su Muyu?

24:06.200 --> 24:07.090
Muyu said

24:07.110 --> 24:08.490
that he had to visit someone.

24:08.510 --> 24:09.700
Therefore, he didn't come with us.

24:10.070 --> 24:10.980
But he'll arrive soon after.

24:11.480 --> 24:12.330
Visit someone?

24:36.070 --> 24:37.010
You've been following me the entire way.

24:42.160 --> 24:43.490
I'm not that free.

24:44.000 --> 24:45.530
My subordinate was the one following you.

24:45.920 --> 24:46.490
Master Su.

24:47.310 --> 24:47.900
Master Ji.

24:49.350 --> 24:50.380
Why did you

24:51.070 --> 24:51.900
arrange for this meeting?

24:53.160 --> 24:54.810
Master Su, did you take anything related to Baixiao Hall

24:55.070 --> 24:56.050
away from

24:56.070 --> 24:57.730
Imperial Father-in-Law's Residence?

24:58.240 --> 24:58.730
If you did,

24:59.310 --> 25:00.330
that'd prove

25:00.750 --> 25:02.420
that my long trip

25:02.750 --> 25:03.660
wasn't in vain.

25:07.790 --> 25:08.770
Master Ji,

25:08.790 --> 25:10.250
your words are still as profound as always.

25:11.960 --> 25:12.810
Is it profound?

25:13.480 --> 25:14.290
I thought

25:14.830 --> 25:17.330
I'd already made it obvious enough.

25:18.720 --> 25:19.460
Did that young archer

25:19.480 --> 25:21.090
of the Xie family tell you about that?

25:21.350 --> 25:22.980
I make my own judgments.

25:26.920 --> 25:28.700
Master Ji, have you been to Wanjuan Tower before?

25:29.920 --> 25:30.980
I've heard about it.

25:31.640 --> 25:32.570
Within Wanjuan Tower

25:33.350 --> 25:34.420
contains Blood River,

25:35.310 --> 25:36.460
the Free Wind Sect,

25:36.720 --> 25:37.290
and...

25:37.310 --> 25:38.730
Baixiao Hall.

25:39.510 --> 25:41.980
Our Baixiao Hall is known as the All-Knowing under Heaven.

25:42.270 --> 25:44.050
We've never held Wanjuan Tower in high regard.

25:44.440 --> 25:46.380
However, for some reason, Wanjuan Tower

25:46.790 --> 25:48.900
contains information related to Baixiao Hall.

25:49.510 --> 25:51.460
It would've been fine if the document had been burned down.

25:51.920 --> 25:52.810
If someone intends to keep it,

25:53.510 --> 25:56.810
no one shall gain access to it.

25:57.240 --> 25:58.530
Among all the shelves,

25:58.550 --> 25:59.900
Baixiao Hall has the fewest books and scrolls.

26:05.640 --> 26:06.490
This is the only book

26:08.480 --> 26:10.050
I've retrieved from Wanjuan Tower.

26:10.500 --> 26:12.740
[Baixiao Hall]

26:13.000 --> 26:14.050
I haven't read it yet.

26:15.550 --> 26:17.530
Master Su, you're a smart man.

26:17.830 --> 26:18.730
Luckily,

26:18.750 --> 26:19.570
we aren't foes yet.

26:20.350 --> 26:21.460
If, one day,

26:21.720 --> 26:22.770
Baixiao Hall and Blood River

26:22.790 --> 26:23.900
turn into foes,

26:24.400 --> 26:24.900
I suppose

26:25.200 --> 26:26.220
you will be

26:26.480 --> 26:28.010
the first person

26:28.350 --> 26:30.220
I have to kill.

26:44.880 --> 26:46.010
I'm showing you this book

26:47.510 --> 26:48.380
not because I intend to make you

26:48.400 --> 26:49.700
owe me a favor.

26:50.200 --> 26:51.460
After all, it would never have existed

26:51.830 --> 26:53.140
had I allowed it

26:53.550 --> 26:54.730
to be burned down in a fire.

26:56.550 --> 26:57.290
I'm showing it to you

26:57.750 --> 26:58.700
because I found out

26:58.720 --> 27:00.570
that the paper of the letter contained in the compartment

27:02.270 --> 27:03.530
was new.

27:05.160 --> 27:06.980
I once intended to buy some intel from Baixiao Hall.

27:07.750 --> 27:08.900
According to them,

27:09.590 --> 27:11.420
that piece of intel would cause an uproar in the martial world.

27:13.200 --> 27:14.220
Therefore, they couldn't sell it to me.

27:14.790 --> 27:15.810
Master Ji, I just want you

27:16.440 --> 27:17.980
to review the piece of intel that I've received.

27:19.200 --> 27:20.250
You just need to tell me

27:21.480 --> 27:21.900
whether it's real

27:23.750 --> 27:24.810
or fake.

27:39.110 --> 27:39.770
All right.

27:48.660 --> 27:50.700
[Wushuang City launched an attack, Blood River sent ninety-three assassins]

27:50.700 --> 27:51.700
[Eighteen survived]

27:56.400 --> 27:56.980
It's real.

27:59.680 --> 28:00.180
Thank you.

28:02.070 --> 28:03.810
Someone stole this document

28:04.110 --> 28:05.620
from Baixiao Hall.

28:06.160 --> 28:08.180
After that, they wrote a new one

28:08.200 --> 28:08.900
and replaced it.

28:09.640 --> 28:11.010
I've seen plenty of switch-outs before.

28:11.270 --> 28:12.940
But switching genuine intel for genuine intel?

28:13.110 --> 28:14.140
This is a first.

28:15.200 --> 28:15.810
Perhaps

28:16.110 --> 28:17.330
it's because the version we recorded

28:17.350 --> 28:18.330
was more detailed.

28:18.590 --> 28:19.860
Perhaps he wanted to please you

28:20.160 --> 28:21.290
with it.

28:21.960 --> 28:22.490
Or perhaps

28:23.510 --> 28:24.770
he wanted you

28:24.790 --> 28:25.660
to receive

28:25.880 --> 28:27.050
certain information from it

28:27.200 --> 28:28.660
so that you could take action.

28:32.640 --> 28:35.660
It seems someone is trying to use you.

28:53.790 --> 28:54.460
About that,

28:54.920 --> 28:56.570
Master Ji, you don't need to worry.

28:58.200 --> 28:59.330
Sorry for being nosy.

28:59.720 --> 29:00.220
Farewell.

29:03.510 --> 29:06.220
Master Su, why are you in a hurry to leave?

29:08.510 --> 29:09.460
The osmanthus cakes of Zhiwei Restaurant

29:09.480 --> 29:10.140
will be for sale soon.

29:12.270 --> 29:13.180
A friend of mine

29:14.590 --> 29:15.380
loves them.

29:17.380 --> 29:22.700
[Heyu Apothecary]

29:26.000 --> 29:27.810
Heyu Apothecary, huh?

29:28.100 --> 29:31.100
[Heyu Apothecary]

29:35.720 --> 29:36.450
Su Muyu.

29:36.590 --> 29:37.250
You're here.

29:42.070 --> 29:42.530
What do you think?

29:42.920 --> 29:44.730
Don't you think it's a great name?

29:48.400 --> 29:49.810
Although I'm the physician here,

29:50.030 --> 29:51.050
and you're just my apprentice,

29:51.640 --> 29:52.530
I still included

29:52.720 --> 29:53.810
your name

29:53.830 --> 29:54.570
just to be fair.

29:55.480 --> 29:58.490
However, for fairness's sake,

29:59.310 --> 30:01.220
you have to fork out half of

30:01.550 --> 30:02.220
the rent here.

30:05.110 --> 30:06.010
Thank you, Miss Bai.

30:08.900 --> 30:10.820
[Zhiwei Restaurant]

30:11.160 --> 30:12.860
Aren't these osmanthus cakes from Zhiwei Restaurant?

30:15.720 --> 30:16.900
Why are you thanking me?

30:17.640 --> 30:19.810
I heard that you visited someone just now.

30:20.240 --> 30:20.700
What?

30:20.880 --> 30:23.860
Do you actually have other friends in Nan'an City?

30:24.640 --> 30:25.330
Strictly speaking, we aren't friends.

30:26.030 --> 30:26.570
We're merely acquaintances.

30:27.200 --> 30:28.900
Coincidentally, we encountered each other here.

30:32.750 --> 30:33.330
Miss Bai.

30:34.550 --> 30:35.050
What's wrong?

30:36.200 --> 30:37.860
Since I own half of the apothecary,

30:41.200 --> 30:42.530
why aren't you inviting me inside?

30:45.310 --> 30:45.730
Please.

30:46.000 --> 30:46.770
Go inside.

30:46.960 --> 30:47.290
Okay.

30:47.340 --> 30:52.100
[Heyu Apothecary]

31:02.640 --> 31:03.250
Where are the rest?

31:04.790 --> 31:07.010
I thought that you were the only one coming.

31:07.640 --> 31:08.140
Therefore,

31:08.160 --> 31:09.770
I only prepared an extra bed.

31:15.550 --> 31:16.250
You see, Fadog

31:16.270 --> 31:17.330
had great foresight.

31:18.000 --> 31:19.700
He knew that Su Changhe would definitely follow you here.

31:20.070 --> 31:20.770
Therefore,

31:20.790 --> 31:21.730
he prepared another bed.

31:24.270 --> 31:25.730
But no one expected you

31:26.830 --> 31:29.010
to bring your childhood sweetheart here.

31:30.440 --> 31:32.010
Therefore, he had no choice but to take them out

31:32.400 --> 31:33.780
to buy some beds

31:33.780 --> 31:34.530
and daily necessities.

31:37.510 --> 31:38.330
I see.

31:43.030 --> 31:44.420
What are you laughing at?

31:47.550 --> 31:48.220
Say,

31:49.550 --> 31:50.530
do you think Changhe

31:50.750 --> 31:51.810
knows how to bargain?

31:57.440 --> 31:57.900
"All these,

31:58.310 --> 31:58.770
and these,

31:59.550 --> 32:00.290
wrap them up for me."

32:00.640 --> 32:01.090
"And those,

32:01.480 --> 32:02.180
and those,

32:02.200 --> 32:02.770
I'll be taking all of them."

32:04.240 --> 32:05.200
"Here's a silver ingot.

32:06.920 --> 32:07.530
Keep the change."

32:10.400 --> 32:11.380
Your imitation was perfect.

32:14.480 --> 32:15.530
Listen.

32:15.720 --> 32:16.900
All men act the same way when they make

32:17.070 --> 32:17.980
a huge fortune in a short period.

32:18.680 --> 32:19.420
Now,

32:19.440 --> 32:20.810
he's the Patriarch of Blood River.

32:21.240 --> 32:22.140
That means

32:22.830 --> 32:23.730
he owns all of their assets.

32:27.960 --> 32:28.460
By the way,

32:29.720 --> 32:32.330
what's with that younger sister of yours?

32:33.350 --> 32:34.290
Why did you suddenly

32:34.310 --> 32:35.220
bring her out

32:35.240 --> 32:36.050
from the Homeland?

32:36.550 --> 32:37.730
Didn't you tell me

32:38.070 --> 32:38.940
that the Homeland

32:39.200 --> 32:40.620
was the safest place in the world?

32:41.880 --> 32:42.770
It's because we found out

32:43.400 --> 32:44.620
that the culprit behind the eradication of No-Sword City

32:45.270 --> 32:46.330
was actually Blood River.

32:47.480 --> 32:48.090
Some of the culprits

32:48.110 --> 32:49.290
are still alive.

32:50.030 --> 32:51.330
They're living in the Homeland as well.

32:53.640 --> 32:54.980
Although they've retired early,

32:55.750 --> 32:56.420
and they won't commit any killings

32:57.110 --> 32:58.530
unless it's necessary,

32:59.680 --> 33:00.980
people still hold a grudge against them.

33:01.550 --> 33:02.420
I cannot feel at ease

33:02.920 --> 33:03.770
if Zhaoyan stays there.

33:04.960 --> 33:06.050
I was reminded of you.

33:07.440 --> 33:08.290
I thought that your place

33:08.640 --> 33:09.730
must be very safe.

33:10.790 --> 33:11.730
You're very reliable.

33:12.270 --> 33:13.570
In addition, Uncle Zhe is here as well.

33:14.400 --> 33:15.290
Zhaoyan will surely be safe

33:15.880 --> 33:16.570
staying with you.

33:22.030 --> 33:23.090
Judging from what you said,

33:23.790 --> 33:26.010
it seems you're entrusting her to me.

33:29.240 --> 33:29.810
Could it be

33:30.160 --> 33:31.250
that you still have other matters

33:31.270 --> 33:31.940
to deal with?

33:35.790 --> 33:37.660
Is it related to No-Sword City?

33:39.200 --> 33:40.330
I won't leave for the time being.

33:41.110 --> 33:42.390
I'll live in Nan'an City for now.

33:44.350 --> 33:46.090
After all, I own half of this apothecary.

33:47.160 --> 33:48.530
I have to do my best to manage it.

33:57.000 --> 33:57.860
Come inside.

34:07.880 --> 34:08.300
Leave them here for now.

34:10.070 --> 34:11.260
I'll think of a way to arrange them.

34:12.110 --> 34:13.890
Put all of the food into the kitchen.

34:14.030 --> 34:14.530
All right.

34:16.110 --> 34:17.340
As for the beds and blankets,

34:17.480 --> 34:17.940
Uncle Zhe,

34:18.110 --> 34:19.170
you can lead them to the rooms and settle down first.

34:20.710 --> 34:21.170
Follow me.

34:23.230 --> 34:24.460
As for the rest,

34:26.280 --> 34:26.980
just leave them here.

34:27.150 --> 34:28.050
I'll think of a way to arrange them.

34:33.320 --> 34:34.460
What did I say again?

34:37.550 --> 34:38.740
What is that?

34:42.590 --> 34:44.530
You see, we encountered a fish seller.

34:44.920 --> 34:46.780
This green jade basin was his family treasure.

34:47.190 --> 34:48.170
In the end,

34:48.190 --> 34:50.530
Changhe wanted to buy it.

34:50.960 --> 34:52.050
The seller sold it to him reluctantly

34:52.070 --> 34:53.090
upon seeing a gold ingot.

34:53.710 --> 34:55.210
After that, he requested this mister to transport it here.

34:58.030 --> 34:58.610
Here's 500 taels.

35:03.480 --> 35:04.170
Share them with your buddies.

35:05.670 --> 35:06.900
Thank you, mister!

35:08.440 --> 35:10.050
Let's go.

35:15.960 --> 35:17.090
This is an apothecary.

35:17.480 --> 35:18.380
It's not a general store.

35:21.280 --> 35:21.980
It's not like I'm decorating the place

35:22.000 --> 35:23.090
like an apothecary.

35:23.400 --> 35:24.130
You see,

35:24.320 --> 35:25.210
this is our house.

35:25.800 --> 35:26.980
From now on, we have to stay here.

35:27.360 --> 35:28.780
Naturally, it shouldn't be too boring.

35:29.150 --> 35:30.010
We have to decorate it

35:30.710 --> 35:31.530
with things we like.

35:33.230 --> 35:35.050
I think you're the only one who likes this.

35:38.320 --> 35:40.010
How come I never knew you liked watching fish?

35:42.190 --> 35:42.900
I never knew you liked watching birds either.

35:46.360 --> 35:47.210
Everyone

35:47.230 --> 35:48.170
has their own preferences.

35:49.190 --> 35:50.610
You like to grind herbs, cook,

35:50.630 --> 35:51.570
and be a good man.

35:52.150 --> 35:53.130
But me?

35:53.550 --> 35:55.820
I like to watch birds, fish, enjoy music,

35:55.890 --> 35:58.260
and live my life as a shameless womanizer.

35:59.230 --> 36:00.130
To each his own.

36:09.460 --> 36:10.310
[Heyu Apothecary]

36:10.310 --> 36:10.860
That's right.

36:13.670 --> 36:14.610
Dear folks

36:14.630 --> 36:15.570
of Nan'an City,

36:16.000 --> 36:16.940
now, I hereby announce

36:17.550 --> 36:18.740
that Heyu Apothecary

36:19.000 --> 36:21.130
is officially open!

36:22.960 --> 36:23.460
Excellent!

36:23.590 --> 36:24.210
Excellent!

36:28.440 --> 36:29.420
I thought our apothecary

36:29.710 --> 36:31.010
was already open long ago.

36:32.110 --> 36:33.420
Changhe said that our business

36:33.440 --> 36:34.420
wouldn't last long

36:34.590 --> 36:35.420
as we waited for patients to come.

36:36.110 --> 36:37.090
We have to use this opportunity

36:37.230 --> 36:39.050
to show the folks

36:39.070 --> 36:40.420
your true capabilities.

36:46.330 --> 36:47.310
It's so lively.

36:49.760 --> 36:50.820
What a lively atmosphere.

36:53.070 --> 36:53.690
It's like a festive occasion.

36:54.800 --> 36:55.490
Yeah.

36:57.230 --> 36:58.010
Apothecary?

36:59.400 --> 37:00.460
If my memory serves me correctly,

37:01.320 --> 37:02.010
this was a place

37:02.280 --> 37:03.570
that depended on good-looking men

37:03.590 --> 37:04.820
to sell expensive medicine.

37:08.070 --> 37:09.300
In Nan'an City,

37:09.320 --> 37:11.430
there are a total of 63 apothecaries of varying sizes.

37:11.510 --> 37:12.650
We also have the Four Famed Physicians

37:12.710 --> 37:13.860
and 30 Sacred Healers here.

37:14.670 --> 37:16.530
You said that this was an apothecary, right?

37:17.550 --> 37:19.610
I wonder who the owner is.

37:20.480 --> 37:21.050
It's me.

37:21.510 --> 37:21.940
Who is that?

37:29.820 --> 37:33.300
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

37:33.340 --> 37:37.220
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

37:39.060 --> 37:42.540
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

37:42.580 --> 37:46.420
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

37:48.420 --> 37:51.700
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

37:51.820 --> 37:53.900
♪Still I can't let go♪

37:54.060 --> 37:57.500
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

37:57.980 --> 38:00.180
♪My heart no longer my own♪

38:00.300 --> 38:05.300
♪No one can escape from love♪

38:21.900 --> 38:25.620
♪How many hidden feelings♪

38:25.740 --> 38:29.820
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

38:31.060 --> 38:34.940
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

38:35.060 --> 38:39.300
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

38:40.420 --> 38:43.300
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

38:43.380 --> 38:47.620
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

38:49.900 --> 38:53.900
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

